# Storyworks core

- Canonical entry: `@AGENTS.md`. Specs live in `docs/` — do not duplicate long essays here.
- Phase 0 is complete. Do not re-scaffold.
- Phase 1 = human-gated design in `apps/web` `/design` only until human sign-off.
- Phase 2+ production only after design approval.
- Light mode only. No dark mode.
- Archive before delete; typed full name required to delete.
- Muse: Tab accept, other key dismiss; never auto-insert.
- Dual VCS: never commit `projects/` or `data/` into the public app repo.
- Interfering builds → backup + temp archive → restore. See `@docs/05_GIT_SYNC.md`.